  "changelog": "narrative-builder 1.0.0 \u2013 Initial Release\n\n- Introduces a composition-focused narrative builder skill, designed to orchestrate complete stories by consuming World Builder and Character Builder outputs.\n- Implements a four-layer pipeline model (input, structure, composition, output) for causal, sequential story construction.\n- Supports two modes: direct narrative construction (Mode A) and character-driven orchestration (Mode B), with input routing based on presence of character/world skill files.\n- Provides comprehensive capabilities: plot structure selection, perspective, pacing, conflict, event orchestration, scene building, theme weaving, dialogue, and multi-level narrative validation.\n- Relies on external world/character files for full operation; does not generate worlds or characters, only arranges them narratively.",
